-- statement:
--   This bundle assembles the interfaces that connect the Section 9 self-improvement result to the main induction step. It converts state-dependent distance into strong self-consistency, transports the section-level conclusion, and records slice-strategy data needed on concrete slices.
--
--   Principal definitions:
--   - `strongSelfConsistency_of_sddRel`: converts same-register state-dependent distance into bipartite strong self-consistency.
--   - `selfImprovementInInductionSectionConclusion_ofSelfImprovementConclusion`: converts the Section 9 conclusion into the induction-section conclusion.
--   - `selfImprovementInInductionSection_of_axisParallel_selfConsistency`: derives induction-section self-improvement from axis and self-consistency bounds.
--   - The slice-strategy transport record supplies the data needed to apply self-improvement on each slice.
--
--   Formalization credit: Sirui Lu, Ruixuan Deng, Yanqiao Zhu, and Zhengfeng Ji (arXiv:2609.19814). Mathematical source: Zhengfeng Ji, Anand Natarajan, Thomas Vidick, John Wright, and Henry Yuen (arXiv:2009.12982).
